  "$comment": [
    "P4.D326 item 16 — the tier-1 corpus for `inventory_image_description_equivalence`.",
    "Drives v4's REAL `renderCarryingPhrase` (lib/inventory/image-description.ts), `sceneDescriptionParts`",
    "(lib/image-gen/appearance-resolution.ts), `buildExpansionContext` (lib/image-gen/prompt-expansion.ts) and",
    "`buildCharacterAvatarPrompt` with NO equippedSlots (lib/image-gen/avatar-prompt.ts — reads no repository then),",
    "at `322a5488e` (`4fbdad186` + the `d88c1ce39` seed test). The `phrases` mirror image-description.test.ts's three",
    "shapes plus the edges: absent / null / '' / whitespace descriptions, a kit, the trailing `.!?` RUN strip (a",
    "description that is ONLY punctuation is an EMPTY element — v4's bytes), base-sensitivity sorting (accents and case",
    "fold, ties keep input order), a title over a name, 40 items. `scene` mirrors appearance-carrying.test.ts's strings",
    "plus the one-UTF-16-unit capitalisation edges (ß → SS, an astral first character unchanged, ǆ → Ǆ, a leading",
    "combining mark unchanged), `expansion` the `Carried` entry, `avatar` the portrait's carrying sentence on the no-outfit branch (the",
    "with-outfit spacing needs equippedSlots — pinned by avatar_job_tier3's carried row)."
